  "construction": [
    "Use the actual same-witness globally uniform N01 coefficient jets. A genuine smooth germ at each physical point permits the installed polynomial discriminant bound without charging a cutoff radius or any extension derivative.",
    "The interpolation low order and loss are selected once before all mixed orders, physical points and components. A finite diagonal sum gives one scalar coefficient sequence depending only on total derivative order.",
    "At any genuine root with either orientation, actual radial division samples only the same physical root. The factor ordinary n-jet is bounded with the exact 2^n factor and one derivative/loss shift.",
    "All final factor numerical constants precede the state, root position, orientation, smooth factor and qualitative radius R. The bound is uniform in those choices."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "This is the actual divided-factor upper jet tower. Its reciprocal and the other same-witness material lower costs remain separate obligations.",
